# Expo performance

Load `react-native-best-practices` and `vercel-react-native-skills` before optimizing or writing list, image, or animation code.

- Virtualize long lists. Memoize row components and keep row callbacks and styles stable.
- Use `expo-image`. Give remote images a size. Do not put large images in the JS bundle.
- Keep expensive work out of render and out of list items. Do not store scroll position in React state.
- Measure before changing architecture. Use release builds for FPS, TTI, and memory checks.
- For EAS Observe metrics, load `eas-observe`.
